            {
                "entry_id": "fd15f7c1-88e3-37a0-8e12-bac3fe414c14",
                "word": "remake",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "079717cf-911e-43e5-aa0f-85be9efb16e1",
                        "entry_id": "fd15f7c1-88e3-37a0-8e12-bac3fe414c14",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "remakes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80adf013-b5c9-335f-987c-31982b55ff23",
                        "entry_id": "fd15f7c1-88e3-37a0-8e12-bac3fe414c14",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Copie ; reprise ; refonte ; réédition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9778380b-0841-4266-95f3-d6c83f2e4f1f",
                                "sense_id": "80adf013-b5c9-335f-987c-31982b55ff23",
                                "text": "En guise de divertissement ludo-culturel et pour s'initier aux joies de la classification et des nomenclatures binominales avec sur les fiches des basidiomycètes ou des ascomycètes identifiant les clavaires ou autres pézizes, la matinée dominicale était agrémentée d'un remake d'émission anecdotiquement baptisée « Qui veut gagner des champignons ? »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af0cf0b4-954c-4ac9-adc2-99bcb839fe7b",
                                "sense_id": "80adf013-b5c9-335f-987c-31982b55ff23",
                                "text": "Et quand une procession entre ou sort de la basilique St-Pierre, les cappa magna surmontés de mitres de leurs Eminentissimes Frivolités, les ceintures violettes, les bures noires, les bures brunes, les bures blanches qui défilent au pas d'une fanfare pontificale me semblent un remake de Fellini."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b25010b-cfc0-4c03-9deb-9cb063b54a92",
                                "sense_id": "80adf013-b5c9-335f-987c-31982b55ff23",
                                "text": "L’artiste n’a fait que déclamer, en plus solennel et en plus délayé, un remake de ses annonces de réformes institutionnelles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ebe315c-ce39-3322-8d66-57ab72fe07fb",
                        "entry_id": "fd15f7c1-88e3-37a0-8e12-bac3fe414c14",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Scène rejouée dans la vie comme dans un film."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "17871c14-a114-431a-862f-f9d807df9d80",
                                "sense_id": "0ebe315c-ce39-3322-8d66-57ab72fe07fb",
                                "text": "Julia considère ce mauvais remake avec fureur."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3645b39f-4648-447b-9436-0e0155df8aaa",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd15f7c1-88e3-37a0-8e12-bac3fe414c14",
                        "target_lang_word": "remake",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "remake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b03240f7-1d40-32db-b587-223f01372c8b",
                                        "entry_id": "9ebda9db-c11e-3104-9536-c394e9a5e122",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A new version of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5416f7f4-3627-3944-9cf9-9927c3d3babf",
                                        "entry_id": "9ebda9db-c11e-3104-9536-c394e9a5e122",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A new, especially updated, version of a film, video game, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29ae2f38-68c9-4a03-af91-0a8115d10e5b",
                                                "sense_id": "5416f7f4-3627-3944-9cf9-9927c3d3babf",
                                                "text": "I haven't seen the original film, but the remake was great."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56044899-2863-403e-adbd-da0e9ff01cb6",
                                                "sense_id": "5416f7f4-3627-3944-9cf9-9927c3d3babf",
                                                "text": "The thing I like most about the Total Recall remake is the—I have to presume ironic—name of its production company. The first words that appear on screen are “Original Film”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddbab8c7-4db4-414f-b9f1-856e2a77af73",
                                                "sense_id": "5416f7f4-3627-3944-9cf9-9927c3d3babf",
                                                "text": "Like Hollywood remakes or remasters old movies, video game publishers are overhauling and rereleasing games to tap into ready-made fan bases for popular franchises like The Legend of Zelda, Crash Bandicoot, Spyro the Dragon and World of Warcraft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "722668ca-1d9f-4df4-a97c-84e63f89fa87",
                                                "sense_id": "5416f7f4-3627-3944-9cf9-9927c3d3babf",
                                                "text": "The family film is the remake of a remake – the 2022 version puts a new spin on the 2003 movie of the same name, which updated the 1950 movie based on the semi-autobiographical novel by siblings Frank Butler Gilbreth Jr and Ernestine Gilbreth Carey."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "remake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1176dcfb-3b81-3715-bad1-50ad644c74d3",
                                        "entry_id": "266c85e2-ab7d-3d09-80fe-ec4069a4dd31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make again."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ec482c-d1f7-4df5-aa49-be5789978976",
                                                "sense_id": "1176dcfb-3b81-3715-bad1-50ad644c74d3",
                                                "text": "You'll need to remake that cake, as it's completely burned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af5164e0-19da-35ca-83fc-3885a77331b7",
                                        "entry_id": "266c85e2-ab7d-3d09-80fe-ec4069a4dd31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a new, especially updated, version of (a film, video game, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6230ca45-4996-4677-abe9-cbbc20d8f166",
                                                "sense_id": "af5164e0-19da-35ca-83fc-3885a77331b7",
                                                "text": "The director wanted to remake some of his favourite films from the Golden Age of Hollywood."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a38d3d0b-425c-4da9-bc29-b1f9fb881da4",
                                                "sense_id": "af5164e0-19da-35ca-83fc-3885a77331b7",
                                                "text": "Fritz Lang in Hollywood has remade the French \"La Bête Humaine\" story, setting the drama, a little coldly, among the great hooting diesels of the Middle West routes, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2793722a-152d-401c-87f6-075d7f084420",
                                                "sense_id": "af5164e0-19da-35ca-83fc-3885a77331b7",
                                                "text": "In 1976 and 1977, and the years to follow, as symbolically remade by the Sex Pistols, it was, perhaps, dadaists, lettrists, situationists, and various medieval heretics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
